      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "WHIRILY MAURZ (9) took full advantage of the inside draw when a dominant winner at Kilmore last start. That made it three wins on the trot, one of those coming at this circuit and distance. Draws on the back line this time but is going well enough to overcome that and deliver again. SENNA STORM (8) has been solid in two outings since taking advantage of the ace draw to score at Kilmore three runs ago. Drawn to enjoy an economical run and the sprint lane is in play. Leading hope if things go his way. MIDNIGHT MOJO (5) is suited up in trip as she has a good record at this circuit and distance. She is on the radar. MISS PIGGY WIGGY (7) draws wide but is hard to knock having added to a string of top-four results when third at Echuca last time out. Include again.",
